Z||000001||SLYGUY||09-20-2001||02:01 PM||||My passenger side isn't working either. I didn't know this until I was having some stereo work done and they wanted to see how much room there was behind the seat. Slid the lever to the side and pulled on the seat and....NOTHING.<P>I've got to find out what is wrong with that too.<P>Good Luck,<P>Sly||||reg||1
