Z||000007||lowfierogt||09-24-2001||01:59 PM||||Tracks are rusted.  <BR>1. Try wd40 on bolts. <BR>2. try wd40 on tracks.<BR>3. unbolt seat<BR>4. clean tracks<BR>5. get BFH<P><BR>I spent 2 hours removing drivers seat.<P>not fun.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com/87%20fiero_files/Jun0302.JPG">  <BR>http://lowfierogt.no-ip.com<BR>86 1/2 GT<BR>85 GT<BR>87 coupe daily driver over 300k miles||||reg||9
